OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFog or low cloud again slow to
OL,6,Fclear but once it does, another day of
OL,7,Flong sunny spells and light winds
OL,8,Ffollows. Widespread fog returns
OL,9,Fovernight into the weekend.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells continue Saturday, then further
OL,13,Ffog developing overnight. Turning
OL,14,Fcloudier on Sunday with some light,
OL,15,Fpatchy rain before long spells of
OL,16,Fsunshine return Monday. Light winds
OL,17,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
